Mapkeeper is a router. It does not bundle or relicense its providers:

- Graphify — external knowledge-graph tool and skill.
  https://pypi.org/project/graphifyy/
- github/spec-kit (MIT) — external CLI and command workflow.
  https://github.com/github/spec-kit
- cloudflare/security-audit-skill (MIT) — external security-audit skill.
  https://github.com/cloudflare/security-audit-skill

No provider source code is copied into this repository. The router reads
provider-owned artifacts only when the user asks for status or links.

The earlier v2 implementation took process inspiration from spec-kit and
security-audit-skill; that implementation has been removed in v3.